From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:26:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(compression): keep the newest skill across
 compaction

compression.keep_last_skill_chars (0 = off): the handoff carries the most recently loaded skill's body when it is at most N chars, instead of a [SKILL_PRUNED] marker that makes the model reload it. When a kept head or tail row still holds the body, the markers for it are dropped. Older skills and larger bodies keep their markers.
